{"id":"torrey:feast-of-jubilee-the","source":"torrey","name":"Feast Of Jubilee, The","slug":"feast-of-jubilee-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Held every fiftieth year — Le 25:8,10.","refs":[["Lev",25,8,25,8],["Lev",25,10,25,10]]},{"text":"Began upon the day of atonement — Le 25:9.","refs":[["Lev",25,9,25,9]]},{"text":"Year of liberty. — Eze 46:17.","refs":[["Ezek",46,17,46,17]]},{"text":"Year of the redeemed. — Isa 63:4.","refs":[["Isa",63,4,63,4]]},{"text":"Acceptable year. — Isa 61:2.","refs":[["Isa",61,2,61,2]]},{"text":"Was specially holy — Le 25:12.","refs":[["Lev",25,12,25,12]]},{"text":"Proclaimed by trumpets — Le 25:9; Ps 89:15.","refs":[["Lev",25,9,25,9],["Ps",89,15,89,15]]},{"text":"Cessation of all field labour. — Le 25:11.","refs":[["Lev",25,11,25,11]]},{"text":"The fruits of the earth to be common property. — Le 25:12.","refs":[["Lev",25,12,25,12]]},{"text":"Redemption of sold property. — Le 25:23-27.","refs":[["Lev",25,23,25,27]]},{"text":"Restoration of all inheritances. — Le 25:10,13,28; 27:24.","refs":[["Lev",25,10,25,10],["Lev",25,13,25,13],["Lev",25,28,25,28],["Lev",27,24,27,24]]},{"text":"Release of Hebrew servants. — Le 25:40,41,54.","refs":[["Lev",25,40,25,40],["Lev",25,41,25,41],["Lev",25,54,25,54]]},{"text":"Houses in walled cities not redeemed within a year, exempted from the benefit of — Le 25:30.","refs":[["Lev",25,30,25,30]]},{"text":"Sale of property calculated from — Le 25:15,16.","refs":[["Lev",25,15,25,15],["Lev",25,16,25,16]]},{"text":"Value of devoted property calculated from — Le 27:14-23.","refs":[["Lev",27,14,27,23]]},{"text":"Illustrative of the Gospel — Isa 61:1,2; Lu 4:18,19.","refs":[["Isa",61,1,61,1],["Isa",61,2,61,2],["Luke",4,18,4,18],["Luke",4,19,4,19]]}],"refCount":27}
